{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26117","headline":"荐冰 · 卢钧","name":"荐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荐冰朝日後，辟庙晓光清。\n不改晶荧质，能彰语露情。\n且无霜共洁，岂与水均明。\n在捧摇寒色，当呈表素诚。\n凝姿陈俎豆，浮彩映牕楹。\n皎皎盘盂侧，棱棱严气生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢钧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}